			<h6 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Welcome to Kenya Literature Bureau PLC</h6>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3745c365 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3745c365" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
								<div class="elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix">
				<p><span style="color: #333333; font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;">KLB is home to some of the world&#8217;s top authors, researchers and experts in book publishing and printing. We pride ourselves in providing high quality educational publications  ranging from school and college text books, dictionaries, autobiographies, storybooks, e-books and offering high end printing services that are unmatched in the East Africa region. We publish in different languages and also offer translation services. We are headquartered in South C Nairobi, Nairobi Kenya and have a Sales and Customer Service Branch along Kijabe Street, Nairobi. We also have an easily accessible team of field staff countrywide. For more information, click  to read  more:</span></p><p><span style="color: #333333; font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;"> </span></p>					</div>
